# For teams: copy to .github/CODEOWNERS, replace @your-org/maintainers, and apply the ruleset with
#   protect.sh --approvals 1   (and set require_code_owner_review to true in ruleset.json)
# A solo owner cannot approve their own PR, so leave this off and review the diff of these paths yourself.
/.github/                    @your-org/maintainers
/.claude/                    @your-org/maintainers
/acceptance/                 @your-org/maintainers
/verify.config.json          @your-org/maintainers
/spec.md                     @your-org/maintainers
/.harness-protected          @your-org/maintainers
